{"action_id": "DELIVERY-000114", "alternatives_considered": "", "basis_id": "BASIS-000014", "confidence": 0.8, "construal": "契約完了後の書面交付はDFH-SAL-026第3項・第7項に従い、申込ID・顧客ID・商品IDをキーに書面交付ログを記録する。案件APP-R28は銀行口座商品で、本人確認済・審査連携済・契約成立済のため、標準フローで書面交付を完了する。", "decision": "deliver_documentsを実行し、書面交付ID DEL-R28-001を採番して記録。", "evidence_plan": "deliver_documentsの返却値を保険証・口座設定書面交付証跡として保存。申込APP-R28の証跡チェーン（同意→eKYC→審査→契約→書面交付）を完了。", "felt_constraints": "", "g1_citation_handle_exists": true, "g1_span_exists": true, "g2_prior_read": true, "g3_entailment": "supported", "g3_machine_heuristic": "supported", "grounded": true, "retrieved": [{"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-026:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-026", "version": "1.1"}, {"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-009:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-009", "version": "1.1"}], "run_id": "root-d0b02", "seat_id": "emp-C", "tick": 36, "trigger_event": "deliver_documents", "ts": "2026-07-29T05:50:57.898662+00:00"}
